          "index": 7,
          "quote": "Currently, we rank putative driver genes by correlating fate probabilities with gene expression. Although this approach has proven powerful, as shown in various applications, it is solely based on correlation. To unravel the causal mechanisms linking molecular properties and changes to fate decisions, perturbation data and causal inference71 can be combined with CellRank 2."
        }
